SUMMARY:NTN Days 2026
DESCRIPTION:NTN Days 2026\, the event dedicated to Non-Terrestrial Networ
 ks\, bringing together academic and industrial communities working on th
 e challenges of non-terrestrial connectivity\, from the physical layerto
  networking and standardization.\n\nTwo keynotes\, four technical sessio
 ns\, a poster session and a roundtable.\nFull program: https://ntndays.s
 pace/#program
LOCATION:Cnam\, 292 Rue Saint-Martin\, 75003 Paris\, France
URL:https://ntndays.space/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
